    desc="Selling a sports card or trading card collection in Erie County, PA: sorting, condition, what PSA, BGS and CGC grading is, and selling lots vs. singles.",
    standfirst="Sort it, protect it, leave it uncleaned and unbanded, understand what grading does, and decide which cards sell alone and which sell together.",
